&lt;h1&gt;Senior Forward Deployed Engineer&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Forward Deployed Software Engineer &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;On-Site:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Grafenwohr, Germany – &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVE TS/SCI Clearance required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Reports to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Echo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Direct reports:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; None. Delta’s provide performance feedback on other engineers and participate in company peer mentorship program.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Travel:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; 0-10%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At PVM, we serve those who serve, as a Palantir ally for mission impact. We are a veteran-founded, Palantir Vanguard partner — and the only small business providing services in that tier. We help&amp;nbsp;our government partners tackle real problems in National Security, Readiness, and Space — not building shelfware.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job__description body&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE), you will build analytical dashboard features, support CI/CD pipeline tasks, and work within a structured agile environment alongside senior engineers and government stakeholders. You will operate in two-week sprint cycles, contributing to feature delivery from design through deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At our organization, an FDE takes ownership of their work — building reliable features, writing meaningful code, and ensuring each sprint increment is production-ready.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deliver front-end analytical dashboard views using Foundry’s Workshop/Slate application layer under guidance from senior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support CI/CD pipeline configuration tasks, including build scripts, automated tests, and environment promotion workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement metric definitions and data transformations aligned to the Foundry Ontology to ensure consistent data interpretation across dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce clear technical documentation, including configuration notes, runbooks, and sprint artifacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in sprint planning, daily standups, sprint reviews, and demonstrations for government stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct testing and validation to confirm dashboards function correctly and data aligns with approved definitions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify integration issues, surface blockers early, and collaborate with senior engineers to resolve them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support defect resolution and incremental enhancements to maintain stable operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:540,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:270,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deep expertise with Palantir Foundry Ontology Manager, Workshop, Actions, Pipeline Builder, and operational application development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python, TypeScript, or Java in cloud-based data platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in government, defense, or classified environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to independently build features, test them, and deliver production-ready functionality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in small, fast-moving technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:540,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:270,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;17&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience conducting ontology reviews, governance assessments, and platform architecture evaluations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About PVM &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At PVM, we mean it when we say we value diversity. As a PVM team member, you will work with people from all different backgrounds that are passionate about the problems we solve for our customers and are focused on delivering value for our clients. Our culture encourages problem solving, leadership, and innovation, and creates an environment that will support your professional and personal growth. Here are a few highlights of the advantages of being a part of the PVM community:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for growth and advancement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition/Training reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer bonus program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote and on-site positions available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PVM delivers digital services that help government agencies unlock the power of their data for good and maximize the value of their technology investments. We design, develop, and deploy solutions to solve mission-critical problems. PVM is a black- and service-disabled veteran-owned small business and was founded by a retired Naval officer out of frustration with the status quo with one goal in mind: to help his fellow Shipmates solve the problems they were facing every day. Today, we continue to be driven by that same goal and are focused on taking on our clients’ missions as our own to make a difference in the communities we serve. PVM believes in equal opportunity employment. We won&#39;t discriminate against any employee or applicant based on race, gender, nationality, age, religion, disability, military status, or sexual orientation. As a company and as individuals, we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive and welcoming environment for our team, our family members, and our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-alert job-alert--margin&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;PVM, Inc. is an SBA 8(a)-certified, Service-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business and Palantir USG Vanguard Partner. PVM is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Marketing Manager | Precision Semiconductor Metrology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Abingdon, UK, with up to 30 percent travel&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reward and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;£69,000 - £80,000 (depending on experience)]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A generous annual bonus, death in service and private health care benefits BUPA, EMI Share scheme (UK).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are a Field Marketing Manager who enjoys connecting advanced technology with the people who need it, why not join us in Abingdon, Oxfordshire, and own the regional go-to-market programmes for advanced semiconductor metrology systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Infinitesima&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Infinitesima is a UK-based pioneer in advanced metrology solutions for the semiconductor industry. Our patented Rapid Probe Microscope (RPM) technology combines the 3D surface detection of atomic force microscopy with high-speed laser actuation and interferometry, delivering sub-nanometre measurements at in-line production throughput. Our Metron3D 300 mm in-line wafer metrology system brings this capability into high-volume manufacturing, addressing process control needs for next-generation devices that optical and electron-beam techniques cannot meet. Metron3D is in use at leading semiconductor manufacturers, and we are growing our team as demand for in-line 3D process control accelerates.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ambitious and adaptable Field Marketing Manager to own our regional go-to-market programmes for semiconductor metrology. You will connect our technology to fab, R&amp;amp;D and advanced packaging customers, equipment partners and industry audiences through trade shows, technical conferences, customer presentations and targeted marketing collateral. You will work closely with Sales, Product Management, Applications, Engineering and Corporate Marketing to build awareness, generate qualified demand and support revenue growth. This role involves travel of up to 30 percent, in the UK and internationally. If your passion is connecting technology with the people who need it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run field marketing plans aligned with business goals, product roadmaps and regional sales priorities, and own our regional go-to-market programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritise the target accounts (IDMs, foundries, memory makers and OSATs), industry segments, trade shows and regional technical symposia that will do the most for pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and oversee technical and commercial collateral, from product briefs and application notes to measurement and demo data summaries, case studies, white papers and sales enablement materials, in line with our brand and product positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex metrology concepts, such as measurement capability, throughput and process control value, into clear, compelling messages for process engineers, metrology teams and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present to customers, partners and industry audiences at conferences, customer sites and webinars, and back Sales up with account-based marketing and executive briefings for key semiconductor accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, Product Management, Applications, Engineering and Corporate Marketing to align messaging, launches and priorities, work with regional sales teams so programmes suit local markets, and share customer, market and competitive insight with Product and Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education and experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in engineering, physics, materials science or a related technical field, or in marketing with a strong technical background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[3]+ years’ relevant marketing experience, ideally in field or technical marketing, within a semiconductor or semiconductor equipment company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and experience we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of the semiconductor ecosystem, including metrology and inspection, fab process control, customers, supply chain and trends such as advanced logic, 3D memory and advanced packaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven record of creating marketing collateral, including technical and product-focused content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and public speaking skills, with experience presenting to customers and industry audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turning complex technical ideas into clear, compelling messages for engineers and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of working well with cross-functional teams, including Sales, Product and Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritising accounts, segments and events to get the most out of pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable travelling up to 30 percent, in the UK and internationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A valid passport and no international travel restrictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’d love to see:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Master’s degree in a technical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with marketing automation and CRM platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in international or multi-region marketing, particularly in Asia (Taiwan, Korea, Japan) or Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our strength lies in the varied perspectives that come from different cultures, experiences, and identities. We believe that true innovation is fuelled by collaboration, locally and globally. We strive to foster an environment where everyone can contribute meaningfully and thrive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;If you require adjustments to take part in the recruitment process, please let us know, we’ll do our best to support you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your recruitment journey:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We will interview you: Monday to Friday UK Time 9am to 4.30pm and we&#39;ll be as flexible as we can with Global Scheduling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1st and 2nd stages stage:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote meetings to evaluate your experience and technical ability and meet some of our global senior team members&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Final stage:&lt;/strong&gt; Face to face onsite to meet our senior leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note on how we use AI:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We use AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to transcribe our interviews so we can focus fully on you instead of scribbling notes. The AI does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;take part in any decision making at any stage. All hiring decisions are made by real humans based on the conversation we have with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires a greater&lt;strong&gt; onsite presence along with up to 30 percent global trave&lt;/strong&gt;l due to the nature of the work and business need&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recruitment agencies: Infinitesima Ltd only works with approved agencies and does not accept unsolicited agency CVs. Please do not submit candidate details in response to this advert or solicit any Infinitesima Ltd employees. Infinitesima Ltd is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited CVs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we&#39;re hiring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Technology provides Technology services for WPP, the world’s largest communications services group. As a creative transformation company, WPP is helping its clients transform the future through extraordinary work. WPP ET is an integral part of that journey, and we are proud to provide technology for some of the world’s most creative brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define the PAM target architecture and controls model, ensuring privileged access is secured by design across the global estate. A retained architecture role setting standards for Kyndryl and engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Design the PAM architecture, controls model and onboarding patterns.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Set standards for privileged-account discovery, vaulting and session control.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Assure partner-delivered PAM designs and changes.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Embed least-privilege and zero-trust principles.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Advise the product owner on platform direction.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Set the architecture, patterns and guardrails that Kyndryl implements and operates within.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Assure that partner-delivered designs and changes meet WPP security, resilience and standards.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Act as design authority and approval gate for partner architecture decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Expert PAM architecture and privileged-access design.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Expert Beyond Trust product knowledge&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Knowledge of vaulting, session management and just-in-time access.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Security architecture and compliance frameworks.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Integration design across infrastructure and applications.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Design-authority and documentation experience.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Recognised architecture experience in the relevant domain at enterprise scale.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Relevant architecture or platform certifications (e.g. TOGAF or vendor architect tracks).&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Degree in a relevant discipline or equivalent experience.• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Sets the target architecture, standards and design patterns for the domain.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Designs for security, scale, resilience and total cost of ownership.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Influences engineering and vendor teams without direct authority.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Balances strategic ambition with pragmatic, deliverable decisions.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Stays current with platform direction and emerging capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;628d56ad5d8a35dab853e65d9daa237c&quot; class=&quot;editor-module-hl-green-solid&quot;&gt;We believe&lt;/span&gt; in the power of creativity, technology and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our clients and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
